    "text": "Let k(G) denote the number of conjugacy classes of a finite group G. Is it\ntrue that k(G) ⩽ k(P1 ) · · · k(Ps ), where P1 , . . . , Ps are Sylow subgroups of G such\nthat |G| = |P1 | · · · |Ps |?                                                     L. Pyber",
